#: d64cb31754c14c8d9a10ca80994f7147 edca8654fc8f49a18d15c4a7cb981901
msgid ""
"The Rx6 pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for "
"all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which"
" require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"Rx6 引脚默认映射为定时器输入，支持所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（这两种协议需要真正的 "
"UART 连接）。但是，FPort 以此方式连接时仅能提供 RC 信号，不含数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:95
#: 0dfb6d738d394e269031f3d1dae917bf 1a14dbd4dcd44b34bb798c993ba98c80
#: 2df3ab74ada140dbaed1264810218f3f ceb4d12ba5eb4fdeae70bca30ebea82a
#: d80cb7125e0d4d21bafd12d9c14f0ef1 f7fb6621a8e649358749dc78e3e39b51
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the Rx6 pin can also be configured to be used as true UART RX pin"
" for use with bi-directional systems by setting the "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL7 "
"port's RX input pin."
msgstr ""
"如需在 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中使用 CRSF 及内嵌数传，可将 Rx6 引脚配置为真正的 UART RX 引脚，将 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设为 「1」，使其成为 SERIAL7 端口的 RX "
"输入引脚，从而支持双向系统。"

